 StyleBox["Purpose",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": Computes the hook length at a specific cell position. Used in the \
hook-length formula for irrep dimensions.\n\n",
 StyleBox["Input Patterns",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ":\n",
 StyleBox["HookLength[YoungTableau[...], {row, col}]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\tHook length at position (row, col)\n\n",
 StyleBox["Formula",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": hook(r,c) = arm + leg + 1\n  where arm = (cells to right) = partition[r] - c\n        leg = (cells below) = transposed[c] - r\n\n",
 StyleBox["Algorithm",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": Uses TransposePartition for O(1) computation per cell."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9785355623092947`*^9, 
  3.978535612943677*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"63e39b87-62e2-4f0d-b14e-\
3b15d620aedc"],

