Cell["\<\
YoungTableau[{2,1}] = {{1,2},{3}}
   - Rows: {1,2} and {3}
   - Columns: {1,3} and {2}

Algorithm:
   Step 1: Symmetrize over {1,2} -> intermediate result symmetric in 1,2
   Step 2: Antisymmetrize over {1,3} -> DESTROYS symmetry in 1,2\
\>", "Text",
